. Through encouragement and support, they can build the confidence to pursue their dreams, advocate for themselves, and live independently.<\\/li><\\/ul><p>\\u00a0Empowering PWDs with love is not just an act of kindness; it\\u2019s a commitment to building a society that sees everyone\\u2019s potential, no matter their physical or cognitive abilities. It\\u2019s about fostering an environment where they are celebrated for who they are and not defined by their disabilities.<\\/p><p>Together, let\\u2019s make the world a place where empowerment with love is not a luxury but a fundamental right for all.<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#585656\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Montserrat\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_letter_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":-0.4,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_word_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":4,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"column_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"19f652fb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"GALLERY\",\"align\":\"left\",\"title_color\":\"#FF00FF\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Montserrat\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":36,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"900\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":46,\"sizes\":[]},\"text_shadow_text_shadow_type\":\"yes\",\"_animation\":\"bounceInLeft\",\"typography_letter_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_word_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":f