ot;_animation&quot;:&quot;bounceInUp&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">nttt<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"> I STARTED AS A n <span style=\"color:#FF00FF\">WEEKEND HOBBY</span>n</h2>tt</div>ntttt</div>ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6bdd0c6 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6bdd0c6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;bounceInUp&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">nttttttt<p>Cristiano Ronaldo, often referred to as CR7, has been an influential figure both on and off the field. Known foru00a0 wealth to make a positive impact through various charitable causes.</p><p>Ronaldo&#8217;s charitable work includes donating millions to causes such as cancer research, disaster relief efforts, and poverty alleviation. One of his most notable donations was in 2016 when he contributed u20ac5 million to the reconstruction of hospitals in Portugal</p><p>.Additionally, Ronaldo has been known to make anonymous donations and regularly visits hospitals and orphanages. His story isn&#8217;t just about football; itu2019s about using his platform and success to help those in need. His charity work has made him a role model for fans worldwide, demonstrating the power of using fame for good.</p>tttttt</div>ntttt</div>ntttt</div>ntttt</div>ntt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9b49cb0 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9b49cb0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">nttttt<div class=\"e-con-inner\">ntt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6178eda e-con-full e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6178eda\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;bounceInRight&quot;}\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3b620ee elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3b620ee\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">nttt<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">THE COMMUNUTYn <span style=\"color:#FF00FF\">PARTICIPATED</span>n</h2>tt</div>ntttt</div>ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-98ac678 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"98ac678\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">nttttttt<p>Community participation is at the heart of any successful NGO. When individuals, groups, and local organizations come together to support a cause, they create a powerful impact. NGOs thrive by engaging with the community, ensuring their voices are heard, and involving them in decision-making processes.</p><p>Through active participation, the community contributes resources, knowledge, and support, which strengthens the overall efforts of the NGO. Volunteers, donors, and local leaders play crucial roles in implementing projects, providing services, and spreading awareness. This collaborative approach fosters a sense of ownership, responsibility, and shared success.</p>tttttt</div>ntttt</div>ntttt</div>ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2ba48bd elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-tablet__width-initial elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2ba48bd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;bounceInLeft&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">nttttttttttttt<img width=\"736\" height=\"490\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Places-Where-Americans-Give-the-Most-to-Charity-2020-Edition.jpg\" class=\"attachment-1536x1536 size-1536x1536 wp-image-655\" alt=\"\" />ttttttttttttt</div>ntttt</div>nttttt</div>ntttt</div>ntt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0ab1d4d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"0ab1d4d\" data-element_type=\"container\">ntt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ecec454 e-con-full e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ecec454\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;bounceInLeft&quot;}\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-695ec31 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"695ec31\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;bounceInDown&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">nttttttttttttt<img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/4209451.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-698\" alt=\"\" />ttttttttttttt</div>ntttt</div>ntttt</div>ntt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d1729f e-con-full e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6d1729f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;bounceInDown&quot;}\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2e061d7 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2e061d7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;bounceInRight&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">nttt<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"> WD DECISDED  TO MAKE ITn <span style=\"color:#FF00FF\">BIGGER AND BETTER</span>n</h2>tt</div>ntttt</div>ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-901c09a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"901c09a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">nttttttt<p>Cristiano Ronaldo, often referred to as CR7, has been an influential figure both on and off the field. Known for his philanthropic efforts, he has used his fame and wealth to make a positive impact through various charitable causes.</p><p>.Additionally, Ronaldo has been known to make anonymous donations and regularly visits hospitals and orphanages. His story isn&#8217;t just about football; itu2019s about using his platform and success to help those in need. His charity work has made him a role model for fans worldwide, demonstrating the power of using fame for good.</p>tttttt</div>ntttt</div>ntt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7e47f9b e-con-full e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7e47f9b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;bounceInUp&quot;}\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-393eefb elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"393eefb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">ntttttttt<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm elementor-animation-bob\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\">ntttttt<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">nttttttttt<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Projects</span>nttttt</span>nttttt</a>ntttttt</div>ntttt</div>ntttt</div>ntttt</div>ntttt</div>ntt\",\"scripts\":[],\"styles\":[]}}'),
