 Shalu are two bright young girls who live in a village where access to education is limited. They dream of going to school, learning new things, and building a future for themselves. But they need our help to make that dream a reality.<\\/p><p>Vidhu and Shalu come from families with limited resources. Their parents are hardworking but struggle to make ends meet. School fees, uniforms, books, and transportation are some of the obstacles preventing these young girls from attending school. Despite their eagerness to learn, these financial hurdles stand in their way.\\u00a0 \\u00a0<\\/p><p>Education empowers individuals, families, and communities. By helping Vidhu and Shalu go to school, we\\u2019re giving them the tools they need to break the cycle of poverty. With the right resources, these young girls can achieve their dreams, improve their communities, and contribute to society in meaningful ways.<\\/p>\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-4dada9a elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\\\" data-id=\\\"4dada9a\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-settings=\\\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;bounceInLeft&quot;}\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"heading.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-widget-container\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<h2 class=\\\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\\\">GALLERY<\\/h2>\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-a5cef62 gallery-spacing-custom e-transform elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-gallery\\\" data-id=\\\"a5cef62\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-settings=\\\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;bounceInDown&quot;,&quot;_transform_skewX_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_skewX_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;deg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&qu