iduals, families, and communities. By helping Vidhu and Shalu go to school, weu2019re giving them the tools they need to break the cycle of poverty. With the right resources, these young girls can achieve their dreams, improve their communities, and contribute to society in meaningful ways.</p>tttttt</div>ntttt</div>ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4dada9a elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4dada9a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;bounceInLeft&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">nttt<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">GALLERY</h2>tt</div>ntttt</div>ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a5cef62 gallery-spacing-custom e-transform elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-gallery\" data-id=\"a5cef62\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;bounceInDown&quot;,&quot;_transform_skewX_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_skewX_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;deg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_skewX_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;deg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_skewY_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_skewY_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;deg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_skewY_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;deg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" data-widget_type=\"image-gallery.default\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">nttttt<div class=\"elementor-image-gallery\">nttt<div id=\'gallery-1\' class=\'gallery gall