&quot;_transform_skewX_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_skewX_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;deg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_skewX_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;deg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_skewY_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_skewY_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;deg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_skewY_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;deg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">nttt<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">EMPOWERING PWDs  <span style=\"color:#FF00FF\">WITH LOVE </span></h2>tt</div>ntttt</div>ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4b2276c2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4b2276c2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">nttttttt<p>Love is a powerful force. Itu2019s not just about affection, but about showing respect, understanding, and care for others. For PWDs, love means seeing them as individuals with unique strengths, talents, and aspirations, rather than defining them solely by their disability.</p><p>When we empower PWDs with love, we create spaces where they feel accepted and encouraged. It&#8217;s about cultivating a culture where:</p><ul><li><strong>Access to Opportunities</strong>: With love comes the responsibility to ensure equal opportunities. Everyone deserves a chance to pursue their goals, whether it&#8217;s education, employment, or social activities. Love means advocating for accessible spaces, inclusive workplaces, and education systems that cater to all needs.</li><li><strong>Support and Understanding</strong>: People with disabilities often face societal misconceptions or biases. By showing love, we help break these barriers, promoting empathy and understanding. This means providing emotional support, offering help when needed, and celebrating their achievements.</li><li><strong>Self-Love and Confidence</strong>: Empowering PWDs with love also means teaching them to love themselves. Through encouragement and support, they can build the confidence to pursue their dreams, advocate for themselves, and live independently.</li></ul><p>u00a0Empowering PWDs with love is not just an act of kindness; itu2019s a commitment to building a society that sees everyoneu2019s potential, no matter their physical or cognitive abilities. Itu2019s about fostering an environment where they are celebrated for who they are and not defined by their disabilities.</p><p>Together, letu2019s make the world a place where empowerment with love is not a luxury but a fundamental right for all.</p>tttttt</div>ntttt</div>ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-19f652fb elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"19f652fb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;bounceInLeft&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">nttt<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">GALLERY</h2>tt</div>ntttt</div>ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8935efa gallery-spacing-custom e-transform elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-gallery\" data-id=\"8935efa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;bounceInDown&quot;,&quot;_transform_skewX_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_skewX_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;deg&quot;,&quot;size&quo