wiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL25nb1wvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMTJcL1doYXQtaXMtdGhlLU1vc3QtQ29tZm9ydGFibGUtTWFudWFsLVdoZWVsY2hhaXJfLmpwZWciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiI4OTM1ZWZhIn0%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/What-is-the-Most-Comfortable-Manual-Wheelchair_.jpeg\'><img width=\"735\" height=\"490\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/What-is-the-Most-Comfortable-Manual-Wheelchair_.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"8935efa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"What is Caregiver_\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6OTE5LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL25nb1wvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMTJcL1doYXQtaXMtQ2FyZWdpdmVyXy5qcGVnIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiODkzNWVmYSJ9\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/What-is-Caregiver_.jpeg\'><img width=\"735\" height=\"490\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/What-is-Caregiver_.jpeg\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-919\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n				<figcaption class=\'wp-caption-text gallery-caption\' id=\'gallery-1-919\'>\n				young asian female nurse care giver helping asian senior old man with mobility walker in living area of nursing home senior daycare center,Nurse take care elderly patient with cheerful concentrate\n				</figcaption></figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"8935efa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"Turismo Inclusivo pt1\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6OTE3LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL25nb1wvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMTJcL1R1cmlzbW8tSW5jbHVzaXZvLXB0MS5qcGVnIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiODkzNWVmYSJ9\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Turismo-Inclusivo-pt1.jpeg\'><img width=\"732\" height=\"400\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Turismo-Inclusivo-pt1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n			</figure>\n[give_form id=\"970\"]', 'EMPOWERING PWDs WITH LOVE', 'People with Disabilities (PWDs) face unique challenges every day, but with the right support, love, and empowerment, they can overcome obstacles and achieve greatness. Empowering PWDs with Love is about creating a world where everyone, regardless of their abilities, is given the tools, opportunities, and respect they deserve to thrive.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'empowering-pwds-with-love', '', '', '2024-12-11 14:31:38', '2024-12-11 14:31:38', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ngo/?p=341', 0, 'post', '', 0),
