e cycle of poverty. With the right resources, these young girls can achieve their dreams, improve their communities, and contribute to society in meaningful ways.</p>		\n			<h2>GALLERY</h2>		\n		http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/AQN3QSyvrrotXnrz4_EFiiZRZK8p8_5HVB-I2RmcnUVwfWbZQ_7h6WlFZxIlyb8DC_yyRMyD3iUQquL0suVMfANP.mp4[give_form id=\"788\"]', 'HELPING ILLITERATE UNDERPRIVILEGED CHILDREN', ' many children, going to school is a dream that is not always possible due to various challenges', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '339-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-12-07 18:30:07', '2024-12-07 18:30:07', '', 339, 'http://localhost/ngo/?p=863', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
