Ds, we help them feel connected and part of society.</p></li><li><p><strong>Breaking Barriers</strong>: Disabling is not the condition itself, but the barriers society puts in place. When we empower PWDs with love, we actively work to dismantle these obstacles, whether they are physical, social, or attitudinal.</p></li></ol>		\n			<h2>GALLERY</h2>		\n			<figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"8935efa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"Indian Rural boy Having Food\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6NTYsInVybCI6Imh0dHA6XC9cL2xvY2FsaG9zdFwvbmdvXC93cC1jb250ZW50XC91cGxvYWRzXC8yMDI0XC8xMVwvaXN0b2NrcGhvdG8tMTc1NjAwNjA3LTEwMjR4MTAyNC0xLmpwZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6Ijg5MzVlZmEifQ%3D%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/istockphoto-175600607-1024x1024-1.jpg\'><img width=\"1024\" height=\"680\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/istockphoto-175600607-1024x1024-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-56\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n				<figcaption class=\'wp-caption-text gallery-caption\' id=\'gallery-1-56\'>\n				Indian Rural boy Having Food\n				</figcaption></figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"8935efa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"Wood burning stove\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6NjcsInVybCI6Imh0dHA6XC9cL2xvY2FsaG9zdFwvbmdvXC93cC1jb250ZW50XC91cGxvYWRzXC8yMDI0XC8xMVwvaXN0b2NrcGhvdG8tNTA4MjIyOTU2LTEwMjR4MTAyNC0yLmpwZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6Ijg5MzVlZmEifQ%3D%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/istockphoto-508222956-1024x1024-2.jpg\'><img width=\"1024\" height=\"682\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/istockphoto-508222956-1024x1024-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-67\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n				<figcaption class=\'wp-caption-t