Ds, we help them feel connected and part of society.</p></li><li><p><strong>Breaking Barriers</strong>: Disabling is not the condition itself, but the barriers society puts in place. When we empower PWDs with love, we actively work to dismantle these obstacles, whether they are physical, social, or attitudinal.</p></li></ol>		\n			<h2>GALLERY</h2>		\n			<figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"8935efa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"close-up-smiley-girl-getting-apples\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MjUwLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL25nb1wvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMTJcL2Nsb3NlLXVwLXNtaWxleS1naXJsLWdldHRpbmctYXBwbGVzLmpwZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6Ijg5MzVlZmEifQ%3D%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/close-up-smiley-girl-getting-apples.jpg\'><img width=\"2048\" height=\"1365\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/close-up-smiley-girl-getting-apples.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"8935efa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"Incomplete Spinal Cord Injury Recovery Time_ What to Expect\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6NDA2LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL25nb1wvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMTJcL0luY29tcGxldGUtU3BpbmFsLUNvcmQtSW5qdXJ5LVJlY292ZXJ5LVRpbWVfLVdoYXQtdG8tRXhwZWN0LmpwZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6Ijg5MzVlZmEifQ%3D%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Incomplete-Spinal-Cord-Injury-Recovery-Time_-What-to-Expect.jpg\'><img width=\"735\" height=\"490\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Incomplete-Spinal-Cord-Injury-Recovery-Time_-What-to-Expect.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\"