AyNFwvMTJcL1doYXQtaXMtQ2FyZWdpdmVyXy5qcGVnIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiODkzNWVmYSJ9\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/What-is-Caregiver_.jpeg\'><img width=\"735\" height=\"490\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/What-is-Caregiver_.jpeg\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-919\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n				<figcaption class=\'wp-caption-text gallery-caption\' id=\'gallery-1-919\'>\n				young asian female nurse care giver helping asian senior old man with mobility walker in living area of nursing home senior daycare center,Nurse take care elderly patient with cheerful concentrate\n				</figcaption></figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"8935efa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"Let the Paralympic Games Begin\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6OTA1LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL25nb1wvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMTJcL0xldC10aGUtUGFyYWx5bXBpYy1HYW1lcy1CZWdpbi5qcGVnIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiODkzNWVmYSJ9\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Let-the-Paralympic-Games-Begin.jpeg\'><img width=\"735\" height=\"525\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Let-the-Paralympic-Games-Begin.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"8935efa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"What is the Most Comfortable Manual Wheelchair_\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6OTIwLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL25nb1wvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMTJcL1doYXQtaXMtdGhlLU1vc3QtQ29tZm9ydGFibGUtTWFudWFsLVdoZWVsY2hhaXJfLmpwZWciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiI4OTM1ZWZhIn0%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/What-is-the-Most-Comfortable-Manual-Wheelchair_.jpeg\'><img width=\"735\" height=\"490\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/What-is-the-Most-Comfortable-Manual-Wheelchair_.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n			</figure>\n[give_form id=\"970\"]', 'EMPOWERING PWDs WITH LOVE', 'People with Disabilities (PWDs) face unique challenges every day, but with the right support, love, and empowerment, they can overcome obstacles and achieve greatness. Empowering PWDs with Love is about creating a world where everyone, regardless of their abilities, is given the tools, opportunities, and respect they deserve to thrive.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '341-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-12-08 09:53:20', '2024-12-08 09:53:20', '', 341, 'http://localhost/ngo/?p=978', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(979, 1, '2024-12-08 09:58:17', '2024-12-08 09:58:17', '<h2> GIVEING IS\n CARING\n</h2>		\n		<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. .</p>		\n													<img width=\"736\" height=\"489\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/50-Heartwarming-Photos-That-Will-Give-You-Hope.jpeg\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h2>EMPOWERING PWDs  WITH LOVE </h2>		\n		<p>Love is a powerful force. It’s not just about affection, but about showing respect, understanding, and care for others. For PWDs, love means seeing them as individuals with unique strengths, talents, and aspirations, rather than defining them solely by their disability.</p><p>When we empower PWDs with love, we create spaces where they feel accepted and encouraged. It\'s about cultivating a culture where:</p><ul><li><strong>Access to Opportunities</strong>: With love comes the responsibility to ensure equal opportunities. Everyone deserves a chance to pursue their goals, whether it\'s education, employment, or social activities. Love means advocating for accessible spaces, inclusive workplaces, and education systems that cater to all needs.</li><li><strong>Support and Understanding</strong>: People with disabilities often face societal misconceptions or biases. By showing love, we help break these barriers, promoting empathy and understanding. This means providing emotional support, offering help when needed, and celebrating their achievements.</li><li><strong>Self-Love and Confidence</strong>: Empowering PWDs with love also means teaching them to love themselves. Through encouragement and support, they can build the confidence to pursue their dreams, advocate for themselves, and live independently.</li></ul><p> Empowering PWDs with love is not just an act of kindness; it’s a commitment to building a society that sees everyone’s potential, no matter their physical or cognitive abilities. It’s about fostering an environment where they are celebrated for who they are and not defined by their disabilities.</p><p>Together, let’s make the world a place where empowerment with love is not a luxury but a fundamental right for all.</p>		\n			<h2>GALLERY</h2>		\n			<figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"8935efa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"Preparing for the 2012 Paralympics\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6OTA4LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL25nb1wvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMTJcL1ByZXBhcmluZy1mb3ItdGhlLTIwMTItUGFyYWx5bXBpY3MuanBlZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6Ijg5MzVlZmEifQ%3D%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Preparing-for-the-2012-Paralympics.jpeg\'><img width=\"736\" height=\"506\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Preparing-for-the-2012-Paralympics.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"8935efa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"Participatiesamenleving eist tol op de werkvloer\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6OTA2LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL25nb1wvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMTJcL1BhcnRpY2lwYXRpZXNhbWVubGV2aW5nLWVpc3QtdG9sLW9wLWRlLXdlcmt2bG9lci5qcGVnIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiODkzNWVmYSJ9\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Participatiesamenleving-eist-tol-op-de-werkvloer.jpeg\'><img width=\"700\" height=\"394\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Participatiesamenleving-eist-tol-op-de-werkvloer.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"8935efa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"94aa1589-3502-4e4b-95ac-103ef36eec64\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6ODk4LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhv