async\" /></a><br />\n			</figure>\n<figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"8935efa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"Are you a caregiver feeling the burnout_ Here are 10 evidence-based strategies to take care of yourself while you care for others_ 🌟#CaregiverSupport #SelfCare #BurnoutRelief\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Are-you-a-caregiver-feeling-the-burnout_-Here-are-10-evidence-based-strategies-to-take-care-of-yourself-while-you-care-for-others_-🌟CaregiverSupport-SelfCare-BurnoutRelief.jpeg\'><img width=\"697\" height=\"570\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Are-you-a-caregiver-feeling-the-burnout_-Here-are-10-evidence-based-strategies-to-take-care-of-yourself-while-you-care-for-others_-🌟CaregiverSupport-SelfCare-BurnoutRelief.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a><br />\n			</figure>\n<figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"8935efa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"Let the Paralympic Games Begin\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6OTA1LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL25nb1wvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMTJcL0xldC10aGUtUGFyYWx5bXBpYy1HYW1lcy1CZWdpbi5qcGVnIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiODkzNWVmYSJ9\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Let-the-Paralympic-Games-Begin.jpeg\'><img width=\"735\" height=\"525\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Let-the-Paralympic-Games-Begin.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a><br />\n			</figure>\n<figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"8935efa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"The Special Olympics, founded by the Kennedy family in 1968, is the largest organization for mentally and physically disabled people in the United States_\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/The-Special-Olympics-founded-by-the-Kennedy-family-in-1968-is-the-largest-organization-for-mentally-and-physically-disabled-people-in-the-United-States_.jpeg\'><img width=\"474\" height=\"267\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/The-Special-Olympics-founded-by-the-Kennedy-family-in-1968-is-the-largest-organization-for-mentally-and-physically-disabled-people-in-the-United-States_.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a><br />\n			</figure>\n<figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"8935efa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"Participatiesamenleving eist tol op de werkvloer\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6OTA2LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL25nb1wvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMTJcL1BhcnRpY2lwYXRpZXNhbWVubGV2aW5nLWVpc3QtdG9sLW9wLWRlLXdlcmt2bG9lci5qcGVnIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiODkzNWVmYSJ9\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Participatiesamenleving-eist-tol-op-de-werkvloer.jpeg\'><img width=\"700\" height=\"394\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Participatiesamenleving-eist-tol-op-de-werkvloer.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a><br />\n			</figure>\n<figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"8935efa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"This Mother Is Using Her Camera to Redefine Spina Bifida\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6OTE1LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL25nb1wvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMTJcL1RoaXMtTW90aGVyLUlzLVVzaW5nLUhlci1DYW1lcmEtdG8tUmVkZWZpbmUtU3BpbmEtQmlmaWRhLmpwZWciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiI4OTM1ZWZhIn0%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/This-Mother-Is-Using-Her-Camera-to-Redefine-Spina-Bifida.jpeg\'><img width=\"700\" height=\"367\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/This-Mother-Is-Using-Her-Camera-to-Redefine-Spina-Bifida.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a><br />\n			</figure>\n<p>[give_form id=\"970\"]</p>\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'SAVE FORES', 'Forests are vital to the health of our planet. They are the lungs of the Earth, producing oxygen, storing carbon, and providing habitats for countless species. Yet, forests around the world are disappearing at an alarming rate. Deforestation threatens biodiversity, accelerates climate change, and impacts the livelihoods of millions. It’s time to act before it\'s too late.\n\nWhy We Need to Save Forests:\n\nClimate Regulation: Forests play a crucial role in regulating the Earth\'s climate by absorbing carbon dioxide, a key greenhouse gas. Deforestation accelerates climate change by releasing stored carbon back into the atmosphere.\nBiodiversity Conservation: Forests are home to over 80% of the world’s terrestrial species. Protecting forests means safeguarding thousands of plant and animal species, many of which are still undiscovered.\nWater Cycle and Soil Health: Forests help maintain the balance of the water cycle and prevent soil erosion. They keep rivers and streams clean and ensure that we have access to clean water.\nLivelihoods and Communities: Millions of people depend on forests for food, medicine, and their livelihoods. When forests are destroyed, these communities face devastating economic and social impacts.\nOur Mission:\nThe Save Forest initiative is dedicated to halting deforestation and promoting sustainable forest management practices. We aim to raise awareness, engage communities, and push for policy changes that protect our forests for future generations.\n\nWhat We Are Doing:\nReforestation and Afforestation Projects: Planting trees and restoring damaged ecosystems to bring forests back to life.\nSustainable Forestry Practices: Promoting responsible, eco-friendly logging methods that preserve forest health.\nEducation and Awareness: Raising global awareness about the importance of forests and how individuals can make a difference.\nAdvocating for Policy Change: Supporting national and international efforts to implement and enforce stronger laws protecting forests.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'save-fores', '', '', '2024-12-08 17:33:28', '2024-12-08 17:33:28', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ngo/?p=1014', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(1015, 1, '2024-12-08 17:22:41', '2024-12-08 17:22:41', '', 'PROMOTING CLEAN ENERGY PROJECTS', 'In a world where environmental challenges are more pressing than ever, the transition to clean, renewable energy sources has never been more crucial. We are committed to building a sustainable future, and our Clean Energy Project is at the heart of this mission.\n\nWhat is the Clean Energy Project? Our Clean Energy Project is an initiative aimed at reducing carbon emissions, conserving natural resources, and providing affordable, renewable energy solutions to communities. By harnessing the power of solar, wind, and other sustainable sources, we aim to decrease our reliance on fossil fuels and create a cleaner, healthier environment for future generations.', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'promoting-clean-enery-projects', '', '', '2024-12-08 17:23:54', '2024-12-08 17:23:54', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ngo/?p=1015', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(1016, 1, '2024-12-08 17:07:48', '2024-12-08 17:07:48', '<h2> GIVEING IS\n CARING\n</h2>		\n		<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. .</p>		\n													<img width=\"236\" height=\"308\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/download-6.jpg\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h2>LETS HELPED  VIDHU AND SHALU  GO TO SCHOOL</h2>		\n		<p>Education is the foundation of a better future, but for many children, going to school is a dream that is not always possible due to various challenges. Vidhu and Shalu are two bright young girls who live in a village where access to education is limited. They dream of going to school, learning new things, and building a future for themselves. But they need our help to make that dream a reality.</p><p>Vidhu and Shalu come from families with limited resources. Their parents are hardworking but struggle to make ends meet. School fees, uniforms, books, and transportation are some of the obstacles preventing these young girls from attending school. Despite their eagerness to learn, these financial hurdles stand in their way.   </p><p>Education empowers individuals, families, and communities. By helping Vidhu and Shalu go to school, we’re giving them the tools they need to break the cycle of poverty. With the right resources, these young girls can achieve their dreams, improve their communities, and contribute to society in meaningful ways.</p>		\n			<h2>GALLERY</h2>		\n			<figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"a5cef62\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"portrait-old-indian-woman\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6NDMsInVybCI6Imh0dHA6XC9cL2xvY2FsaG9zdFwvbmdvXC93cC1jb250ZW50XC91cGxvYWRzXC8yMDI0XC8xMVwvcG9ydHJhaXQtb2xkLWluZGlhbi13b21hbi5qcGciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiJhNWNlZjYyIn0%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portrait-old-indian-woman.jpg\'><img width=\"2048\" height=\"1148\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/portrait-old-indian-woman.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"a5cef62\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"mother-preparing-food-kitchen-with-son\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MjUxLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL25nb1wvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMTJcL21vdGhlci1wcmVwYXJpbmctZm9vZC1raXRjaGVuLXdpdGgtc29uLmpwZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImE1Y2VmNjIifQ%3D%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/mother-preparing-food-kitchen-with-son.jpg\'><img width=\"2048\" height=\"1365\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/mother-preparing-food-kitchen-with-son.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"a5cef62\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"Indian Rural boy Having Food\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6NTYsInVybCI6Imh0dHA6XC9cL2xvY2FsaG9zdFwvbmdvXC93cC1jb250ZW50XC91cGxvYWRzXC8yMDI0XC8xMVwvaXN0b2NrcGhvdG8tMTc1NjAwNjA3LTEwMjR4MTAyNC0xLmpwZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImE1Y2VmNjIifQ%3D%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/istockphoto-175600607-1024x1024-1.jpg\'><img width=\"1024\" height=\"680\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/istockphoto-175600607-1024x1024-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-56\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n				<figcaption class=\'wp-caption-text gallery-caption\' id=\'gallery-1-56\'>\n				Indian Rural boy Having Food\n				</figcaption></figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"a5cef62\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"Wood burning stove\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6NjcsInVybCI6Imh0dHA6XC9cL2xvY2FsaG9zdFwvbmdvXC93cC1jb250ZW50XC91cGxvYWRzXC8yMDI0XC8xMVwvaXN0b2NrcGhvdG8tNTA4MjIyOTU2LTEwMjR4MTAyNC0yLmpwZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImE1Y2VmNjIifQ%3D%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/istockphoto-508222956-1024x1024-2.jpg\'><img width=\"1024\" height=\"682\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/istockphoto-508222956-1024x1024-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-67\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n				<figcaption class=\'wp-caption-text gallery-caption\' id=\'gallery-1-67\'>\n				Wood burning stove\n				</figcaption></figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"a5cef62\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"close-up-smiley-girl-getting-apples\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MjUwLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL25nb1wvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMTJcL2Nsb3NlLXVwLXNtaWxleS1naXJsLWdldHRpbmctYXBwbGVzLmpwZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImE1Y2VmNjIifQ%3D%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/close-up-smiley-girl-getting-apples.jpg\'><img width=\"2048\" height=\"1365\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/close-up-smiley-girl-getting-apples.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"a5cef62\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"Incomplete Spinal Cord Injury Recovery Time_ What to Expect\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6NDA2LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL25nb1wvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMTJcL0luY29tcGxldGUtU3BpbmFsLUNvcmQtSW5qdXJ5LVJlY292ZXJ5LVRpbWVfLVdoYXQtdG8tRXhwZWN0LmpwZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImE1Y2VmNjIifQ%3D%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Incomplete-Spinal-Cord-Injury-Recovery-Time_-What-to-Expect.jpg\'><img width=\"735\" height=\"490\" src=\"http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Incomplete-Spinal-Cord-Injury-Recovery-Time_-What-to-Expect.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n			</figure>\n		http://localhost/ngo/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/AQN3QSyvrrotXnrz4_EFiiZRZK8p8_5HVB-I2RmcnUVwfWbZQ_7h6WlFZxIlyb8DC_yyRMyD3iUQquL0suVMfANP.mp4[give_form id=\"788\"]', 'FREE MADICAL CARING FOR VALNERBLE FAMILIES', ' In today\'s world, access to quality healthcare is a fundamental need. Yet, many families in vulnerable situations often face the harsh reality of not being able to afford the care they desperately need. But we believe that health should never be a luxury — it is a right for all, regardless of income or background.\n\nIntroducing Free Medical Care for Vulnerable Families – a compassionate initiative dedicated to offering free medical services to families who need them the most.\n\nOur Mission\nOur mission is to provide accessible, high-quality medical care to families experiencing financial hardships. From routine checkups to emergency treatments, we are committed to ensuring that every family member, regardless of age or condition, receives the medical attention they deserve.\n\nWhat We Offer:\nFree Health Consultations: Professional healthcare consultations for all family members.\nMedical Treatments: Vital treatments and procedures without any cost.\nVaccinations and Preventative Care: Ensuring that children and adults are protected from preventable diseases.\nSpecialized Care: Access to specialists for chronic conditions, mental health support, and more.\nMedication Assistance: Free or subsidized prescription medications.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'free-madical-caring-for-valnerble-families', '', '', '2024-12-08 17:08:20', '2024-12-08 17:08:20', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ngo/?p=1016', 0, 'post', '', 0),
